[*  Copyright 2026 Jack Henry and Associates
**
**  PowerOn Name:             BANNO.NEWSUBCREATE.V2.POW
**  Datafile Name:            BANNO.NEWSUBCREATE.V2.CFG
**  Letterfile Name:          BANNO.NEWSUBCREATE.TERMS.00-19
**  Letterfile Name:          BANNO.NEWSUBCREATE.FEEDISC.00-19
**  Fee Display PowerOn Name: BANNO.NEWSUBCREATE.FEES.V2.POW (template)**
**  --------------------------------------------------------------------
**  Program Summary
**  --------------------------------------------------------------------
**  This Banno service PowerOn allows the user to open a new  share on the main account, add a joint, fund.
**
**  --------------------------------------------------------------------
**  Program states and JSON returns
**  --------------------------------------------------------------------
**    STATE:  PRELOADDATA
**  PROCESS:  Process PRELOADDATA state and create json response
**     PASS:  @RGUSERCHR1 n/a
**            @RGUSERNUM1 n/a
**   RETURN:  Provides UX PRELOADDATA response
**
**    STATE:  GETTERMSFUNDING
**  PROCESS:  Process GETTERMSFUNDING state and create json response
**     PASS:  @RGUSERCHR1 Member's selected group number (category)
**            @RGUSERCHR2 Member's selected share type
**            @RGUSERNUM1 n/a
**   RETURN:  Provides UX GETTERMSFUNDING response
**
**    STATE:  NAMEPRELOAD
**  PROCESS:  Process NAMEPRELOAD state and create json response
**     PASS:  @RGUSERCHR1 Member's selected group number (category)
**            @RGUSERCHR2 Member's selected share type
**            @RGUSERCHR3 Type of funding (electronic, check or later)
**            @RGUSERCHR4 Funding source (10-digit account,S/L for Share or Loan and the Share or Loan ID)
**            @RGUSERCHR5 Funding amount
**            @RGUSERNUM1 n/a
**   RETURN:  Provides UX NAMEPRELOAD response
**
**    STATE:  CREATESHARE
**  PROCESS:  Process CREATESHARE state and create json response
**     PASS:  @RGUSERCHR1 New share details
**            @RGUSERCHR2 New name record #1
**            @RGUSERCHR3 New name record #1 (continued)
**.           @RGUSERCHR4 New name record #2
**            @RGUSERCHR5 New name record #2 (continued)
**            @RGUSERNUM1 n/a
**   RETURN:  Provides UX CREATESHARE response
**
**  --------------------------------------------------------------------
**  Error codes and Logging Messages
**  --------------------------------------------------------------------
**  500: Program running in memo mode
**  501: Error reading/opening config file
**  502: Account warning exists
**  503: Ineligible account type
**  504: No eligible shares to be created
**  505: Error reading ToC for group
**  506: No Shares with sufficient funds to xfer
**  507: Error reading passed name info
**  508: Next ID calculation error
**  509: Error getting new share rate 
**  510: Could not calculate new maturity date
**  511: Error creating new share
**  512: Maximum share limit error
**  513: Error calculating fee
**  514: Error reading fee disclosure for group
**  515: No existing open Shares/Loans on the account 
**  516: Config file validation error
**
**  --------------------------------------------------------------------
**  Additional Information
**  --------------------------------------------------------------------
**  For more information check
**  https://github.com/Banno/banno-powerons
**
**  Banno is not responsible for any modifications to this file
**  made by unauthorized personnel.
**
**  DO NOT MODIFY THIS FILE UNLESS YOU KNOW WHAT YOU'RE DOING!
**
**  --------------------------------------------------------------------
**  Modification History
**
**    Ver. 2.0.0  07/23/2026 R. Robison: Original V2 version of Open Subshare PowerOn
**                           Feature set based on: BANNO.NEWSUBCREATE.V1.POW Ver. 1.6.0  07/25/25
**                       
**    
*]
SYMCONNECT
STATELESS

TARGET=ACCOUNT

DEFINE
